    familyNote:
      "Include each dependent child aged 15 or under who is a permanent resident on your form when you lodge; there is no extra charge and the child becomes a citizen when you do. Partners apply in their own right and must each meet the residence requirement. Children aged 16 or 17 must lodge their own application on paper (Form 1290, A$365 or A$40 concession). A child born in Australia to a permanent resident or SCV parent may already be a citizen by birth.",
